fmstick (2.0) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Qt6 port, packaged for Debian 12 (amd64, arm64).
  * Vast HiFi-FMT support: USB sound card volume, firmware quirks.
  * Simple main screen in French, restyled advanced mode.
  * New web page mirroring the simple screen, usable from a phone.
  * RadioText from the track a media player is playing (MPRIS).
  * Audio processing presets, 75 kHz deviation budget by default.
  * RDS: text in the RDS character set, RadioText that TEF receivers
    show, clock time as UTC with the local offset at each minute.
  * PS/RT on air remembered across restarts; power also shown in mW.
  * Many fixes (frequency read on connect, on/off from the menus...).

